                <text type="warning_situation">
				<p>MODERATE FLOODING EASING AT CHINCHILLA WEIR</p>
<p>MINOR FLOOD PEAK POSSIBLE AT CONDAMINE DURING WEDNESDAY EVENING</p>

				<p/>
				<p>Rainfall during last week across the Upper Condamine River catchment has caused river level rises and minor to major flooding along the Condamine River. The flood peak is now passing Chinchilla Weir. Further downstream at Condamine a minor flood peak is possible during Wednesday evening. </p>

				<p/>

                </text>
                <element type="severity">Moderate</element>
